  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  SceneInitialization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e4ed4c69e9996274b8d27fddc2d46329,
    type: 2}
  TutorialSteps:
  - ID: 0
    Message: <b><color=#ff6961>Enemies</color></b> are about to attack! Use <b><color=#000080ff>WASD</color></b>
      or the directional keys to move the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 1
    Message: Hold down the <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      to rotate the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 9
    Message: <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on the <b><color=#008000ff>Castle</color></b> to select it
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a47b9b8056d702440bcb33d00f85dbec, type: 2}
  - ID: 10
    Message: <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on the <b><color=#000080ff>Deploy</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Button</color></b>
      (left bottom) to train a new <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b>
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 2
    Message: '<b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on your new  <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b> to show its <b><color=#000080ff>Specializations</color></b>:
      <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b> on
      the <b><color=#000080ff>Lifter</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Icon</color></b>
      to specialize your <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b>'
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49cb457e009efd147a19ae2390ed3102, type: 2}
  - ID: 6
    Message: '<b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on your new  <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b> to show its <b><color=#000080ff>Specializations</color></b>:
      <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> c<b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on the <b><color=#000080ff>Lifter</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Icon</color></b>
      to specialize your <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b>'
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c9b79b3f155e18408e4e4ddc4a8858a, type: 2}
  - ID: 4
    Message: <b><color=#000080ff>Right</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on a <b><color=#000080ff>Turret</color></b> to set it as a destination for your
      selected <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b>. If your <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b>
      is strong enough, it will lift it!
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79cab4e1c80ed1a4e8a7096d6f1659bc, type: 2}
  - ID: 5
    Message: 'While your <b><color=#000080ff>Unit</color></b> is carrying a turret:
      <b><color=#000080ff>Right</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      to set a new destination and to drop the <b><color=#000080ff>Turret</color></b>
      in that point'
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 11
    Message: You can also specialize <b><color=#000080ff>Turrets</color></b>, click
      on it and specialize it!
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 12
    Message: After specialization, both <b><color=#000080ff>Turrets</color></b> and
      <b><color=#000080ff>Units</color></b> can be upgraded. Click on <b><color=#000080ff>Units</color></b>
      or <b><color=#000080ff>Turrets</color></b> and upgrade it
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 8
    Message: "\rYou are ready! Press the <b><color=#000080ff>Next</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Wave</color></b>
      banner to start the action! \r\nRemember: in each moment, you can deploy new
      <b><color=#000080ff>Units</color></b>, specialize them and <b><color=#000080ff>Turrets</color></b>
      and give them orders"
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0003d6f8efa78084ca5fcfc6757ff6b0, type: 2}
  - ID: 7
    Message: <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      on the <b><color=#000080ff>Pause</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Button</color></b>
      to stop the game action. While in this mode, you can still select and upgrade
      upgrade your <b><color=#000080ff>Units</color></b> and <b><color=#000080ff>Turrets</color></b>.
      You can set new destinations for your <b><color=#000080ff>Units</color></b>
      as well
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
  - ID: 7
    Message: <b><color=#000080ff>Left</color></b> <b><color=#000080ff>Click</color></b>
      again on the pause button to resume the action
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
